{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811401-line","text":"这是哪里？…你喃喃自语。你掉入了无垠黑暗中，这里没有光线，方向无法辨寻。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line","text":"神秘的嗡鸣在你的耳边响起，巨大的吸力拉扯你。你的精神力变得异常懒散。环绕你的气流并无实体，你肌肉松懈，眼皮蜷缩…","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-2662027868483530962-choice","text":"你还可以*沦陷其中*。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice","text":"前往黑暗。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect","text":"前方好像有一张无形的巨大黑网…","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line","text":"这是一个异常可怕的体验。虚无吞没了你，你慌忙逃窜。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-4658431180861248167-choice","text":"对抗引力。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-13514957801537101088-effect","text":"涣散的精神需要集中。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811406-line","text":"这是一个异常可怕的体验。虚无吞没了你，你感到自己被抽走了生命力。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
